-      //     "according to authority %s\nPossible reasons are listed at "
-      //     "http://wiki.ros.org/tf/Errors%%20explained",
-      //     stripped.child_frame_id.c_str(), time_to_sec(stripped.header.stamp),
-      //     authority.c_str());
